 "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says the team 'gets alerted' but the ground truth has no NotificationsWithSubscribers, so no notification check. PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says 'actual cost' but two ground-truth budgets set UseAmortized true, so UseAmortized is not checked. Budgets are identified by service CostFilters (whole object regex); amounts compared numerically (10000 vs 10000.0). A budget using the newer FilterExpression instead of CostFilters is not recognised; none of the real templates write that. Omitted Include flags are handled by AWS's defaults: credit, discount, refund and tax default to true so must be set false, while recurring, upfront and other subscription default to true so may be omitted."
